   "source": [
    "# DSN Bootcamp Qualification Hackathon 2026 \u2014 ML Track\n",
    "### Predicting `total_sales` for a product-store combination\n",
    "\n",
    "**This notebook reproduces the exact pipeline that scored `1070.66` RMSE on the public leaderboard.**\n",
    "\n",
    "Workflow, matching the competition brief: Explore \u2192 Analyse \u2192 Clean \u2192 EDA \u2192 Feature Engineer \u2192 Model \u2192 Evaluate \u2192 Predict.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Evaluation metric:** Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE) on `total_sales`, lower is better."
   ]
  },
