   "source": [
    "## 6. Build & Evaluate the Model\n",
    "**Model: a blend of `ExtraTreesRegressor` (90%) + `RandomForestRegressor` (10%).**\n",
    "\n",
    "ExtraTrees consistently outperformed RandomForest, GradientBoosting, and HistGradientBoosting in cross-validated testing on this feature set. *(Note: XGBoost/LightGBM/CatBoost were not available in the environment this was built in \u2014 a real gradient-boosting library would likely do noticeably better; see the closing note.)*\n",
    "\n",
    "5-fold cross-validation is used throughout so the RMSE estimate reflects unseen data, matching how the leaderboard evaluates `test.csv`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": [
      "Model: a blend of ExtraTreesRegressor (90%) + RandomForestRegressor (10%).\n",
      "ExtraTrees consistently outperformed RandomForest, GradientBoosting, and\n",
      "HistGradientBoosting in cross-validated testing on this feature set (no XGBoost/\n",
      "LightGBM/CatBoost were available in the environment this was built in).\n",
      "\n",
      "Features used: ['store_code_te', 'product_category_te', 'store_format_te', 'product_price', 'store_age_years', 'vis_ratio_product', 'product_weight_kg', 'shelf_visibility', 'product_te']\n",
      "Fold 1: RMSE = 1064.78\n",
      "Fold 2: RMSE = 1048.15\n",
